1. Introduction
In this experiment, I learned about tokenization and compared three subword tokenization approaches: Byte Pair Encoding (BPE), WordPiece and SentencePiece.
The experiment focused on understanding how different pretrained tokenizers split English, Telugu and Hindi text into smaller tokens.

2. What I Did
Created a Python project for comparing different tokenizers.
Used the GPT-2 tokenizer for BPE.
Used Multilingual BERT for WordPiece.
Used XLM-R for SentencePiece.
Tested the tokenizers using English, Telugu and Hindi sentences.
Displayed the generated tokens, token IDs and total token count.
Executed the program and compared the results produced by all three tokenizers.

